          <p>A form submission that lives in a spreadsheet is a form submission you'll lose track of. Form management software fixes that: centralized library, role-based access, workflow rules that route submissions to the right owner, and an audit trail on every response.</p>
          <p>Formester centralizes every form in Workspaces, gives you admin/editor/viewer roles, and stamps every submission with IP, timestamp, user-agent, and submitter identity. Available as a CSV, JSON, or PDF export on Business. GDPR, UK GDPR, and CCPA compliant.</p>
