            <svg class="fmstr-cmp-fmg-quality-control__check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span class="fmstr-cmp-fmg-quality-control__item-text"><strong>Signer identity</strong> captured alongside the signature: full name, email, and any other fields you added.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="fmstr-cmp-fmg-quality-control__item">
            <svg class="fmstr-cmp-fmg-quality-control__check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
