    <div class="fmstr-cmp-fmg-privacy-data-ownership__text">
      <span class="fmstr-cmp-fmg-privacy-data-ownership__eyebrow">Privacy and data ownership</span>
      <h2 id="fmstr-cmp-fmg-privacy-data-ownership-heading" class="fmstr-cmp-fmg-privacy-data-ownership__heading">Your consent records belong to you. We don't train on them</h2>
      <div class="fmstr-cmp-fmg-privacy-data-ownership__body">
        <p>When you upload a PDF, paste a prompt, or generate a form, that content is used to generate your form and nothing else. Per Section 4.4 of our DPA, Formester does not use Customer Data for analytics, advertising, marketing, or product training. The Google Gemini integration we use to power AI features inherits the same boundary.</p>
        <p>Encrypted in transit and at rest, hosted on Heroku and AWS, automated encrypted backups with a 90-day retention, and full data deletion on request. We are GDPR, UK GDPR, and CCPA compliant. We are not SOC 2 or ISO 27001 certified yet, and we will tell you so directly rather than dance around it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

